2026-06-02 15:05:34 +00:00: 3:05:34 PM [express] GET /api/admin/prompt-texts 200 in 23ms :: {"mm:new_caller_closest_to_you.mp3":"new caller closest to you","mm:greeting_setup.mp3":"Your last profile you recorded is still available. To use it again, press 1. To record a new profile, press 2. To hear your profile, press 3. To repeat these choices, press 9","mm:zip_code_prompt.mp3":"enter your 5-digit zip code and we'll play callers closest to you","mm:main_menu.mp3":"main menu! for the connector press one, purchase time, press two. for membership prices, press three. to manage your membership, press star, to hear how much time you're membership has, press zero. to repeat these choices press 9","mm:closest_callers_info.mp3":"Here is how the male box finds callers closest to you. If we have your ZIP code, we use it to play nearby callers first when they are available. Your exact location is never announced, and other callers do not get your phone number or private information. If no nearby callers are available, you will still hear other active callers so the line keeps moving.","mm:phone_booth_welcome.mp3":"Welcome to the connector hear profile's from all the local guys here right now swap private messages and then connect live for a totally private conversation. You can leave the connector at any time by pressing pound","mm:free_mode_announcement.mp3":"The Male box is completely free right now. No membership required, Enjoy unlimited time on the system. have fun and stay safe.","mm:name_saved_record_greeting.mp3":"okay, now you need to record your profile. make your message clear, direct, and to the point. Tell the guys what you've got, and what you want.  begin recording after the tone press any key when done.","mm:info_menu_v2.mp3":"Information, prices, and membership. Press 1 for membership questions. To learn how the male box knows which callers are closest to you, press 2. Press 9 to return to the main menu.","mm:membership_questions.mp3":"Membership questions. Press 1 to learn how membership works. Press 2 to hear our pricing. Press 3 to purchase a membership with a credit card. Press pound to return to the main menu.","mm:profile_options.mp3":"Press 1 to send this caller a message. Press 2 to skip to the next profile. Press 3 to connect live with this caller. Press 4 to block this caller. Press 5 to hear the previous profile. Press 6 to hear this caller's location. Press 7 to flag this profile for review. to hear the choices again press 9 to exit the connector press pound","mm:zip_code_saved.mp3":"got it, we'll use your zip code to find other callers who are closest to you.","mm:new_caller_close_to_you.mp3":"new caller close to you","mm:profile_flagged.mp3":"sent to the moderator for review","mm:message_sent.mp3":"Your message has been sent. returning to profiles","mm:message_send_error.mp3":"Failed to send your message. returning to profile","mm:message_flagged.mp3":"sent to the moderator for review","mm:live_invite_options.mp3":"to accept press 1, to decline and hear the next caller's greeting press 2, to hear this caller's greeting press 3, to block this caller press 4","mm:message_cancelled.mp3":"Message cancelled","mm:system_greeting.mp3":"Welcome to the male box, this service is for men looking to connect with other men","mm:num_0.mp3":"0","mm:live_connect_connecting.mp3":"You're connected. You can break the connection at any time by pressing the pound key. Say hi!","mm:live_connect_failed.mp3":"We were unable to connect your call. returning to profiles","mm:live_invite_expired.mp3":"That live connection invitation has expired. returning to profiles","mm:purchase_pre_menu.mp3":"If you have a promotional code press 1. to purchase the 24 hour backdoor access pass for $3.99 press 2, to repeat these choices press 9, to cancel press pound","mm:motd_post_purchase.mp3":"You may check your time remaining on your membership by pressing zero at any time","mm:message_options.mp3":"to connect live with this caller, press 1. to reply with a message, press 2. to skip this message, press 3. to hear the last message you sent them, press 4. to save this message, press 5. to block this caller, press 7. to hear this caller's greeting and location, press 8. to repeat this message and menu choices, press 9. to exit or change your greeting, press pound.","mm:record_message.mp3":"record your message after the tone, press any key when done","mm:no_caller_id.mp3":"we could not identify your call, goodbye","mm:region_unavailable.mp3":"this market is temporarily unavailable, please try again later.","mm:invalid_choice.mp3":"invalid choice.","mm:goodbye.mp3":"thank you for calling, goodbye.","mm:live_connect_busy.mp3":"That caller is already connected with someone else. Please try again later","mm:live_connect_disclaimer.mp3":"Please be respectful and kind. You are about to request a live one on one connection","mm:no_recording.mp3":"No recording was detected","mm:live_connect_ended.mp3":"Your live connection has ended. returning you to the male box","mm:membership_entry_prompt.mp3":"if you have a membership card, enter your card number now, otherwise press the pound key","mm:record_reply.mp3":"record your reply after the tone. press any key when done","mm:review_your_message.mp3":"here is your recorded message","mm:phrase_callers_on_the_line.mp3":"guys on the line","mm:phrase_caller_on_the_line.mp3":"guy on the line","mm:phrase_days_of_pbtr.mp3":"days remaining","mm:phrase_day_of_pbtr.mp3":"day remaining","mm:link_code_invalid.mp3":"that code is invalid or has expired, please generate a new code from your web account and try again.","mm:phrase_hour_of_pbtr.mp3":"hour remaining","mm:phrase_hours_of_pbtr.mp3":"hours remaining","mm:phrase_minute_of_pbtr.mp3":"minute remaining","mm:phrase_minutes_of_pbtr.mp3":"minutes remaining","mm:live_connect_no_minutes.mp3":"You need at least 5 minutes remaining on your membership to connect live, Please add more time and try again","mm:live_connect_left_line.mp3":"Sorry, that caller has left the line","mm:live_connect_unavailable.mp3":"This caller is not available for a live connection","mm:cs_account_label_time.mp3":"Time remaining:","mm:motd_phone_booth.mp3":"None","mm:no_previous_profile.mp3":"There is no previous profile. Continuing to the next","mm:nearby_callers_none.mp3":"There are no callers online in nearby cities right now. Starting your area over","mm:nearby_callers_offer.mp3":"You've heard all the callers in your area. Press 1 to hear callers from nearby cities. Press 2 to start over from the beginning","mm:time_deduction_stop.mp3":"Time is no longer being deducted from your membership","mm:payment_intro.mp3":"Your purchase, plus any applicable fees and taxes, will appear on your credit card statement as Toby Media. When entering your card information: to correct an incorrect number, press star to delete the last digit entered. To start over, press the star key twice. If you're ready to enter your credit card information press 1","mm:payment_activation_error.mp3":"Your payment was received but there was an error activating your membership. Please contact customer support","mm:live_connect_listening.mp3":"They're listening to your request right now. Please hold a moment for their response.","mm:caller_blocked.mp3":"caller blocked you will no longer hear this caller's profile.","mm:motd.mp3":"None","mm:motd_main_menu.mp3":"None","mm:review_greeting.mp3":"To accept and continue, press 1. To re-record, press 2. To hear your profile, press 3. To repeat these choices, press 9.","mm:payment_success_suffix.mp3":"Thank you for joining. Returning to the main menu","mm:payment_declined.mp3":"Your card was declined. Please check your details and try again","mm:cs_account_label_membership.mp3":"Membership type:","mm:live_connect_accepted.mp3":"He liked what he heard, and he's ready to connect with you.","mm:payment_failed.mp3":"Your payment could not be completed at this time. Please try again later","mm:time_deduction_start.mp3":"Time is now being deducted from your membership","mm:live_time_warning.mp3":"Warning: you have less than 3 minutes remaining. Please note your live connection will end when your time expires.","mm:disclaimer.mp3":"if you're under 18 please hang up now. the male box asumes no responsibility for personal meetings. we do not screen caller's so please use caution before giving out your address, telephone number or any other personal information. ","mm:welcome_record_name.mp3":"You need to record a profile to introduce yourself to the other guys. First let's record the name you want to use. After the tone, record just your first name.","mm:payment_session_expired.mp3":"Your session has expired. Please start again","mm:package_invalid.mp3":"Invalid selection","mm:package_cancelled.mp3":"Cancelled. Returning to the main menu","mm:package_confirm_suffix.mp3":"If this is correct press one. To select a different package press two","mm:greeting_error.mp3":"That profile was too short. Please try again after the tone. Press any key when done.","mm:no_greeting_found.mp3":"No profile found.","mm:profile_saved.mp3":"Your profile has been saved.","mm:recording_rejected_unclear.mp3":"We need you to re-record your profile. We couldn't understand what you said. Please speak clearly into the phone so everyone can hear what you have to say about yourself and what you're looking for. Be sure to turn down any loud music or the television before you record. To re-record, press 1.","mm:recording_rejected_phone_number.mp3":"We need you to re-record your profile. Phone numbers are not allowed in your profile and it will not be approved if it contains one. To re-record, press 1."}
